// Plan and the derived monthly Plan (phased) by financial year and Spending Review group, as the signed-in user sees
// them: only the groups all of whose departments are the user's.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group],
    "plan", [Plan],
    "plan_phased", [Plan (phased)]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group]
